# 统一换行：仓库内存 LF，检出也保持 LF，避免 Windows 上 CRLF/LF 来回产生「整文件改动」
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制/资源文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary

# 批处理保持 Windows 换行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
